{"items":[{"id":"442331002","root":"442331002","user":{"id":"41290","name":"00000-R","avatar":"8d6b2640bf2ab701f9e12fcc"},"text":"好耶[emot=acfun,1805/]","time":1621691201854,"floor":28,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442321253","root":"442321253","user":{"id":"14633746","name":"狗椛-rua","avatar":"266e63af5bb4b446dc53410b"},"text":"一体机性能比较多样但是没有专精，有一些基本的东西自己能做就做，但是有的还是要请专业人才来比较好[emot=acfun,1689/]\n\n\n其实主要是没钱请人帮忙做[emot=acfun,1711/]","time":1621690264752,"floor":27,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"442359221","root":"442321253","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"太真实了，主要是专精人士太贵了请不起[emot=acfun,1870/][emot=acfun,1870/]","time":1621694026372,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"442299646","root":"442299646","user":{"id":"1705969","name":"今天提了嘛?","avatar":"b8d9a75eaa4c057ff3051c1b"},"text":"阿水连每一条回复都看了，甚至还会回复[emot=acfun,1689/]可以想像是多么负责的人","time":1621687070810,"floor":25,"likes":9,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442293032","root":"442293032","user":{"id":"22199062","name":"一片淡雪❄️","avatar":"764ec63f68affc16f7eb0aeb"},"text":"只需要一点点话术技巧和社交常识，找人帮忙其实是一件很简单的事情，至于他们帮不帮那就是另一回事了。一回生两回熟，万事开头难，尽管也很怕在陌生的领域触发负面反馈，但是人与人之间的纽带总是这样的啊，会有开心的事情也会有不开心的矛盾，人生并不是只有一帆风顺。像阿水这样温柔感性的好姑娘，我觉得，只要是朋友的话，合理的请求肯定难以拒绝的。","time":1621686114137,"floor":24,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442287175","root":"442287175","user":{"id":"212476","name":"CAY全家桶","avatar":"36e96461c5690041cf23e210"},"text":"在时间有限的情况下，把部分别人能够胜任的工作托住付给他人，不失为一种折中之选。而且一体机在部分领域可能跟他人全力专精的存在差距，把这方面交给他人也是追求作品的精益求精。[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621685579137,"floor":23,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"442288151","root":"442287175","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"说得很对","time":1621685667228,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"442282385","root":"442282385","user":{"id":"38902323","name":"婵纪元60","avatar":"8718d63e60d01bd40a3dbb2d"},"text":"所以，阿水这是自驱式优秀[emot=acfun,1816/]","time":1621685144461,"floor":22,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442282125","root":"442282125","user":{"id":"13446878","name":"欠债雀士银之间半步尊爵","avatar":"d7b3297ac2ab8cedea9e945f"},"text":"看样子水姐的问题不是能力不够而是时间不够呢，这就是强者吗[emot=acfun,1689/]\n其实我觉得倒也不必考虑那么多，比如找画师画画，也是应该要给画师一定的报酬吧，算是甲方乙方的关系，没有谁给谁添麻烦一说吧，而且只要说话态度不差，相信对方就算拒绝也不会有什么不满情绪[emot=acfun,1683/]\n唉，也就都是理论，至于如何说话或者进一步深入关系，我也老社恐了，只能多实践吧[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621685120879,"floor":21,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"442286517","root":"442282125","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"真正的强者效率更高，这样时间也会足够～约稿这种倒也不存在哪方更高贵的情况，只是说交流确实也要花费很多功夫[emot=acfun,1689/]所以我很佩服内外都可以调理得很顺的人。","time":1621685520022,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442296680","root":"442282125","user":{"id":"13446878","name":"欠债雀士银之间半步尊爵","avatar":"d7b3297ac2ab8cedea9e945f"},"text":"建议多去相亲，有效锻炼与人交流能力[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621686593992,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"442280724","root":"442280724","user":{"id":"855261","name":"神设定","avatar":"db0b59a3d4b6e2847e992e44"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1689/]差不多，不过区别在于我可以等，特别是工作，前一个人拖半个月，我就可以多摸半个月。同样也尽量不麻烦别人，因为我不喜欢&quot;交流&quot;[emot=acfun,1689/]当然纯粹聊天我很喜欢","time":1621684992415,"floor":20,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442277594","root":"442277594","user":{"id":"39087204","name":"闲云九霄","avatar":"8aabd0110ef4fa54b009437b"},"text":"我的经验是\n1，和领域内做得好的人聊其领域的东西。（需要结识更多优秀的人）\n2，不要羞于求助于可以求助的好朋友，适当互相帮助有利于增进友谊。","time":1621684707627,"floor":19,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"442283933","root":"442277594","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"对，这两点是重点，也是难点[emot=acfun,1870/]","time":1621685286777,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"442272638","root":"442272638","user":{"id":"250753","name":"reznov的白由","avatar":"2f9e7b5e98305518b67cf2f7"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1930/][emot=acfun,1930/][emot=acfun,1930/]阿水缺我一个","time":1621684252754,"floor":17,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442269574","root":"442269574","user":{"id":"7379348","name":"小救星小灶","avatar":"7c2bc7eb134c7c0ee879ef3b"},"text":"那就接单，然后拿接单赚的钱去约画师。这样既可以了解不同画师的风格，也可以知道妹妹仔的奇思妙想。[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621683968709,"floor":16,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"442275024","root":"442269574","user":{"id":"28245228","name":"瑟心","avatar":"e35269a298449ed181bd9f79"},"text":"万一是抠脚大汉[emot=acfun,1728/]","time":1621684471870,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442275185","root":"442269574","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"不错的想法，我倒也约过一次稿，成稿和自己想象的大相径庭，我就意识到自己不是合格的甲方[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621684486743,"floor":1,"likes":3,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442292604","root":"442269574","user":{"id":"7379348","name":"小救星小灶","avatar":"7c2bc7eb134c7c0ee879ef3b"},"text":"阿水还是太温柔了[emot=acfun,1683/]","time":1621686075391,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"442269199","root":"442269199","user":{"id":"869274","name":"千寻℃","avatar":"8c383118e4f1f74f8ea10152"},"text":"其实对于我来说很多的时候是&quot;与其和别人沟通需求，不去我自己来干来的简单方便&quot;\n特别是工作上的事情，能自己做就自己做，不会就学，不懂就自己百度。因为和同事沟通，交代事情，花费的时间远远不如自己动手来的高效。\n交代一个事情下去，可能三天都不见搞好，而且不一定是自己想要的效果，自己俩小时搞定了。\n有些人是真的墨迹，看着他们干活我都累得慌。\n所以慢慢也就养成了啥事儿都自己干的习惯","time":1621683933839,"floor":15,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"442271175","root":"442269199","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"对！！！就是这样长期下去，会丧失一些对他人的信任[emot=acfun,1684/]效率这种事真的是挺微妙的，自己做也不见得有效率（如果事情堆积的话），但别人做也不见得有你快（比如熟悉程度不一样）。所以真的很需要学会如何平衡……","time":1621684117496,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442276288","root":"442269199","user":{"id":"28245228","name":"瑟心","avatar":"e35269a298449ed181bd9f79"},"text":"这就不得不说我和我爸了\n我们俩干活就是都想自己揽下，因为都觉得对方做的不行[emot=acfun,1756/]","time":1621684586755,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442287363","root":"442269199","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"哈哈哈，有点像我在家里（不过我是单方面被鄙视的那一方哈哈哈","time":1621685595945,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"瑟心","replyToUserId":"28245228","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"442266833","root":"442266833","user":{"id":"1144684","name":"风格豆腐丶","avatar":"748956af4ed1271d1b6333fb"},"text":"完全理解，工作中通过寻求帮助来改善快被固化的人际关系，简单来说就是芝麻点事都问下同事；开始都是很难开口的，加油吧[emot=acfun,1678/]","time":1621683720832,"floor":14,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"442268570","root":"442266833","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"哈哈哈这确实是个不错的办法，就怕别人弄烦了[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621683876936,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442284967","root":"442266833","user":{"id":"1144684","name":"风格豆腐丶","avatar":"748956af4ed1271d1b6333fb"},"text":"姐，这个业务是这样一个流程嘛[emot=acfun,1683/]，能麻烦讲解一下吗（心理其实一清二楚），大概就是这么个语气[emot=acfun,1692/]","time":1621685380724,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"442264857","root":"442264857","user":{"id":"290576","name":"酋长万岁","avatar":"29a30d56ba7fc904f8b90a2e"},"text":"确实，人与人对问题的解决思考方式不同，很大程度上可以帮你一起参考出正确的方案，这样子抱大腿的我如是回答道","time":1621683537168,"floor":13,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"442264372","root":"442264372","user":{"id":"419474","name":"棉花街","avatar":"ee2737a83a4978ca0704a818"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1684/]其实可以搞几张纯图看看，比如星鸟画画，然后阿望在旁边扫地，水曜日穿着围裙在做饭这种。画图如果长期只在舒适区，感觉久了会越看越疲劳。当然我这可能不对，因为我本身也不会画，但是我现在总会给找点不一样的题目给画师。如果最后的图出的够好，我也挺满足","time":1621683493248,"floor":12,"likes":3,"isU